@startuml
title Diagram 4 — Siklus Hidup Lead → Peluang

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

state "Lead — New" as LB
state "Lead — In Progress" as LK
state "Lead — Lost" as LH
state "Contact + Account + Opportunity\n(hasil convert)" as CONV

[*] --> LB : lead ditangkap\n(manual / import / webhook inbound)
LB --> LK : punya Owner\n+ mulai qualification
LK --> LH : tidak lolos qualification\nLH --> LK : dibuka kembali
LK --> CONV : convert

state "Pipeline Opportunity" as PIPE {
  state "Qualification" as S1
  state "Needs Analysis" as S2
  state "Demo" as S3
  state "Proposal" as S4
  state "Negotiation" as S5
  state "Decision Pending" as S6
  state "Closed-Won" as CW
  state "Closed-Lost" as CL

  [*] --> S1
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> CW : won
  S6 --> CL : lost (+alasan)
}

CONV --> S1
CW --> [*]
CL --> [*]

note right of PIPE
  Stage default: 6 stage + 2 outcome.
  Pipeline, stage, dan kriteria keluar diatur tenant;\n  tenant boleh punya lebih dari satu pipeline (mis. B2C lebih pendek).\n  Stage boleh mundur dengan alasan wajib.
  Tahap prospecting tidak diulang di sini —
  sudah dilayani Lead Management.

  Nilai deal pada Closed-Won menjadi
  sumber revenue & quota attainment.
end note

note bottom of LH
  Alasan Lost dicatat untuk analisis,
  bukan untuk penilaian individu.
end note
@enduml
